---
// Footer.astro - Notion warm canvas-soft document footer
const pathname = Astro.url.pathname;
const isHindi = pathname === '/hi' || pathname === '/hi/' || pathname.startsWith('/hi/');
const isArabic = pathname === '/ar' || pathname === '/ar/' || pathname.startsWith('/ar/');
const isRussian = pathname === '/ru' || pathname === '/ru/' || pathname.startsWith('/ru/');
const isItalian = pathname === '/it' || pathname === '/it/' || pathname.startsWith('/it/');
const isPortuguese = pathname === '/pt' || pathname === '/pt/' || pathname.startsWith('/pt/');
const isFrench = pathname === '/fr' || pathname === '/fr/' || pathname.startsWith('/fr/');
const isSpanish = pathname === '/es' || pathname === '/es/' || pathname.startsWith('/es/');
const isGerman = pathname === '/de' || pathname === '/de/' || pathname.startsWith('/de/');
const isJapanese = pathname === '/ja' || pathname === '/ja/' || pathname.startsWith('/ja/');
const isChinese = pathname === '/zh' || pathname === '/zh/' || pathname.startsWith('/zh/');
---

<footer class="w-full border-t border-hairline bg-canvas-soft text-ink-secondary mt-16 py-12">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mb-8 pb-8 border-b border-hairline">
      <!-- Col 1: Brand Info -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-[#1e1e1e] border border-hairline shadow-xs flex items-center justify-center p-0.5 shrink-0">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-full h-full text-black dark:text-white" viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none">
              <polygon points="32,6 56,19 32,32 8,19" fill="currentColor" />
              <polygon points="8,23 30.5,35 30.5,57 8,45" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.38" />
              <polygon points="33.5,35 56,23 56,45 33.5,57" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.78" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="font-bold text-base text-ink tracking-tight">thevolumecalculator.com</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted max-w-sm leading-relaxed">
          {isHindi
            ? '16 ज्यामितीय आकृतियों, औद्योगिक टैंकों और पाइपों के लिए त्वरित 3D आयतन कैलकुलेटर, वास्तविक समय इकाई रूपांतरण के साथ।'
            : isArabic
            ? 'حاسبة حجم ثلاثية الأبعاد دقيقة وسريعة تدعم 16 مجسمًا هندسيًا وخزانات وأنابيب صناعية مع تحويل فوري للوحدات.'
            : isChinese
            ? '免费、快速且全面的 3D 体积计算器，支持 16 种几何形体、工业储罐与管道容积计算，提供实时单位换算与推导算式。'
            : isJapanese
            ? '16種類の立体、タンク、配管に対応した無料の高精度3D体積計算機。瞬時の単位換算と途中計算式を表示します。'
            : isRussian
            ? 'Бесплатный быстрый 3D калькулятор объема для 16 геометрических фигур, резервуаров и трубопроводов с пересчетом единиц в реальном времени. Разработан для инженеров, студентов и повседневных расчетов.'
            : isItalian
            ? 'Calcolatore di volume 3D gratuito, rapido e completo per 16 forme geometriche, cisterne e tubazioni con conversione di unità in tempo reale. Progettato per studenti, tecnici e ingegneri.'
            : isPortuguese
            ? 'Calculadora de volume 3D gratuita, rápida e abrangente para 16 formas geométricas, tanques e tubulações com conversão de unidades em tempo real. Projetada para estudantes, técnicos e engenheiros.'
            : isFrench
            ? 'Calculateur de volume 3D gratuit, rapide et complet pour 16 formes géométriques, cuves et tuyaux avec conversion d\'unités en temps réel. Adapté aux étudiants, techniciens et ingénieurs.'
            : isSpanish
            ? 'Calculadora de volumen 3D gratuita, rápida y completa con soporte para 16 figuras geométricas, tanques, tuberías y conversión instantánea de unidades. Diseñada para estudiantes, ingenieros, arquitectos y uso cotidiano.'
            : isGerman
            ? 'Kostenloser, schneller 3D-Volumenrechner mit Unterstützung für 16 geometrische Körper, Tanks, Rohre und sofortige Einheitenumrechnung. Entwickelt für Schüler, Ingenieure, Architekten und den Alltag.'
            : 'A free, fast, and comprehensive 3D volume calculator supporting 16 geometric shapes, tanks, pipes, and instant multi-unit conversions. Built for students, engineers, architects, and everyday use.'}
